  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Ungdomspartnerskap LSU-Go-For F&#xF6;rstudie</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Youth Partnership LSU-Go-For Pre-Study</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the project is to serve as a bridging fund to maintain human resources of Go-For and to build on the relations between LSU and Go-For to produce a successful full application to Sida to meet the needs of the youth field. 

The project is structured around 1 Outcome and 2 Outputs.

Outcome 1: Professional relations between LSU and GoFor will be maintained and strengthened. 
New possibilities of new cooperations and a wider network between members organisations of LSU and GoFor will be achived. 

Output 1:  Full Application Folder

Output 2:  Needs Assessment Report From the Field Visits</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det &#xF6;vergripande m&#xE5;let med projektet &#xE4;r att fungera som &#xF6;verbryggande finansiering f&#xF6;r att bevara GoFors humankapital och st&#xE4;rka relationerna mellan LSU och GoFor f&#xF6;r framst&#xE4;llandet av en fullst&#xE4;ndig ans&#xF6;kan till Sida som m&#xF6;ter ungdomars behov.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to serve as a bridging fund to maintain human resources of Go-For and to build on the relations between LSU and Go-For to produce a successful full application to Sida to meet the needs of the youth field.</narrative>
  </description>
